From ed054e092447e4bbb184f4960c51752efe6c8fa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:19:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: import the vendor ccci_util for MT6897
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Import, unmodified, the MediaTek CCCI utility library (modem boot
information from LK, reserved and shared memory layout, image checks,
logging) and its mt-plat header from the MiCode kernel_device_modules
tree used by MT6897 devices. It is not built yet; the next commit adapts
it to this kernel.

Link: https://github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_device_modules (commit 3c4ccd07d5624879555ec710c11bb8818e5cb5c6, drivers/misc/mediatek/ccci_util, drivers/misc/mediatek/include/mt-plat/mtk_ccci_common.h)
Source commit: 3c4ccd07d562 "Kernel: Xiaomi kernel_device_modules changes for
Redmi K70E Android U" by 何发云 <hefayun@xiaomi.com>, 2024-01-12.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
